  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "1.1.6: fix \"Edit Items...\" smart tag link doing nothing in the .NET 6/8/10 out-of-process designer — it now opens the string collection editor through the designer client (InvokePropertyEditor), matching the property grid \"...\" button. 1.1.5: native ComboBox-style smart tag — \"Use Data Bound Items\" checkbox switches bound/unbound mode; unbound mode offers \"Edit Items...\" opening the built-in string collection editor (Items now design-time editable and serialized with the form); bound mode offers the data-source drop-down and member fields. 1.1.4: real data-source drop-down + localized smart tag labels. 1.1.3: smart tag in the .NET 6/8/10 out-of-process designer. 1.1.1: ListControl-style data binding. 1.1.0: Chinese manual; categorized toolbox.",
